\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">6</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>• as well as a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>Pick them up from the <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>The caravan driver's age: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>The registered licence issued in: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_4_1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3126011-recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_4_2.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-g2-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 11-16","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the flow-chart below.</p><p>Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.</p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong>Harvesting and Processing Cocoa Beans</strong></p><p>Chocolate beans are <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">11</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q11\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and then bags are shipped.</p><p>↓</p><p>Bags are then <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">12</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q12\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and weighed by machines.</p><p>↓</p><p>Next chocolate beans are <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">13</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q13\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in a hopper.</p><p>↓</p><p>After being roasted at a high temperature</p><p>↓</p><p>Boiled chocolate beans are <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">14</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q14\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and cracked.</p><p>↓</p><p>Roasted beans needs to be <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">15</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q15\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>↓</p><p>Roasted beans are <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">16</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q16\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in the pocket.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-g2-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 17-20","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>What does each type of coffee taste like?</p><p>Write the correct letter, A-D, next to Questions 17-20.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"matching-dnd-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • First Crack<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">17</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q17\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • Green Beans<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">18</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q18\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • French Roast<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">19</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q19\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • Espresso Smoky<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">20</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q20\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching\"><div class=\"dnd-panel-instruction\">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div><div class=\"dnd-cards-container\"><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"A\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">A.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">intense</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"B\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">B.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">mild</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"C\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">C.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">chocolaty</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"D\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">D.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">smoky</span></div></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_4_2.mp3"],"order_index":2},{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-p3","title":"Part 3","part_number":3,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3126012-recent_actual_test_4_academic_listening_test_4_3.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-g3-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 21-26","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>Choose the correct letter, A, B or C.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">21</strong> What is the thing that makes the Moa similar to dinosaur?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q21\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>Both are of interest to the public.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q21\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Both are extinct at similar time.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q21\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>Both left lots of fossil remains.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">22</strong> What is the difference between Moa and other birds?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>no wing bones</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>a long tail</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q22\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>a smaller head</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">23</strong> What's the special feature of their chicks?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>They never return to the nests.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>Most of them die within two months after birth.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q23\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>They can find food by themselves.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong> What is the tutor's opinion on male hatching the eggs?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>She doubts whether it is true or possible.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>She thinks it may be true.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>She can say with certainty that it is true.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong> What is the male student's response after hearing some people see a Moa recently?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>He is surprised.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>He is worried.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q25\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>He is amused.</span></div></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong> Why did the Moa become extinct?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>climate change</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>human interference</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>competitions with other animals</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":6},{"id":"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-g3-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"matching_features","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 27-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><p>What is the feature of different types of the Moa?</p><p>Choose FOUR answers from the box and write the correct letter, A-F, next to Questions 27-30.</p></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"matching-dnd-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • the North Island Giant Moa<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • the Crested Moa<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • the Stout-legged Moa<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"> • the Eastern Moa<span class=\"options-drop-zone dnd-zone\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-practice-source-4-t4-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"drop\"></span></span></div></div><div class=\"options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching\"><div class=\"dnd-panel-instruction\">Drag and drop an option to fill in each blank.</div><div class=\"dnd-cards-container\"><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"A\"><span class=\"dnd-label\">A.</span><span class=\"dnd-text\">the much taller female</span></div><div class=\"dnd-card\" data-luma-drag=\"B\">